    "pub-column",
    "<h2>烹饪高手：碳钢锅or铸铁锅，怎么选？</h2>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<p><strong>▲ 碳钢锅（铁皮锅）</strong></p>\n<p>宜家的碳钢锅选用台湾黑皮钢，高纯铁导热更快更均匀，锅底厚（1.8mm) 锅壁薄，升温快却不易糊底，烹饪时更易掌握火候。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e5/01/e501766348a16f34381065b9b3cc2232.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/fa/c7/fac7e0a61bffecc7595e2f9d9048c4f8.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e5/01/e501766348a16f34381065b9b3cc2232.jpg",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/fa/c7/fac7e0a61bffecc7595e2f9d9048c4f8.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "<h2>烹饪新手：不粘锅助你轻松入门</h2>\n<p>不粘锅满足了对便捷烹饪的需求，锅体轻盈更利于操作，并且易清洁。不沾锅支持少油，健康的饮食习惯。适用于做饭经验不足的新手。</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
